s="os-nav-label" style="margin-top:8px">Finance</div><nav class="os-nav"><a href="finance_center.php"><i class="dot"></i>Finance Center</a><a href="finance_journal.php"><i class="dot"></i>Journal</a><a href="finance_profit_loss.php"><i class="dot"></i>P&amp;L</a><a href="finance_reconciliation.php"><i class="dot"></i>Reconciliation</a></nav><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canSecurity)):?><div class="os-nav-label" style="margin-top:8px">Security</div><nav class="os-nav"><a href="security_center.php"><i class="dot"></i>Security Center</a><a href="user_management.php"><i class="dot"></i>Users</a><a href="security_sessions.php"><i class="dot"></i>Sessions</a><a href="step17_audit.php"><i class="dot"></i>STEP 17 Audit</a></nav><?php endif;?></aside><main class="os-main"><section class="os-hero s10-hero"><div class="os-kicker">BUSINESS OS • STEP 10 → 17</div><h1>Business data is now protected by authenticated users, role permissions and revocable sessions.</h1><p>The dashboard only exposes modules the signed-in account is allowed to view. Finance and Security remain hidden unless the current role has those explicit permissions.</p><div class="os-status-row"><span class="os-chip <?= $error===null&&$m['legacy']===757?'good':'' ?>"><?= $error===null?'SECURE BUSINESS OS LIVE':'Review required' ?></span><span class="os-chip good"><?= (int)$m['legacy'] ?> / 757 legacy</span><span class="os-chip good"><?= (int)$m['products'] ?> products</span><span class="os-chip good">RBAC ACTIVE</span></div></section><?php if($error):?><div class="pp-alert bad"><strong>Dashboard diagnostic:</strong> <?= security_step17_h($error) ?></div><?php endif;?><section class="s10-kpis"><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Signed In Role</small><strong><?= security_step17_h(strtoupper((string)($user['role_code']??''))) ?></strong><span>module permissions enforced</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Products</small><strong><?= (int)$m['products'] ?></strong><span>PDF-backed catalog</span></div><?php if(!empty($canInventory)):?><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Sellable Stock</small><strong><?= security_step17_h(d17n($m['stock'])) ?></strong><span>STEP 13 inventory</span></div><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canCustomers)):?><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Customer Receivable</small><strong><?= d17m($m['receivable']) ?></strong><span>permission-protected CRM</span></div><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canPurchases)):?><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Supplier Outstanding</small><strong><?= d17m($m['supplier_due']) ?></strong><span>permission-protected purchases</span></div><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canFinance)):?><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Finance Journals</small><strong><?= (int)$m['journals'] ?></strong><span><?= (int)$m['cash_accounts'] ?> cash/bank accounts</span></div><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canSecurity)):?><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Active Users</small><strong><?= (int)$m['users'] ?></strong><span><?= (int)$m['sessions'] ?> active sessions</span></div><div class="s10-kpi"><small>Failed Logins • 24h</small><strong><?= (int)$m['failed24'] ?></strong><span>security audit signal</span></div><?php endif;?></section><section class="s10-grid"><article class="s10-card s10-span-12"><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2>Allowed Workspaces</h2><p>Only links permitted for <?= security_step17_h($user['full_name']??'this user') ?> are shown below.</p></div></div><div class="os-links"><?php if(security_step17_has_permission($pdo,'business.view',$user)):?><a class="os-link" href="operations_center.php"><div><b>Business Operations</b><span>Orders, VP, income and operational facts</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?><?php if(security_step17_has_permission($pdo,'reports.view',$user)):?><a class="os-link" href="report_center.php"><div><b>Live Reports</b><span>Six derived workbook reports</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canCustomers)):?><a class="os-link" href="sales_fulfillment.php"><div><b>Customer Fulfillment</b><span>Invoice, delivery, return, refund and receivable</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canFinance)):?><a class="os-link" href="finance_center.php"><div><b>Finance & Accounting</b><span>Journal, cashbook, P&amp;L, cash flow and reconciliation</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canSecurity)):?><a class="os-link" href="security_center.php"><div><b>Security & Access</b><span>Users, roles, permissions, sessions and audit</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($canAudit)):?><a class="os-link" href="audit_center.php"><div><b>Business Audit</b><span>Operational audit and data quality</span></div><span>→</span></a><?php endif;?></div></article></section><div class="os-footer-note"><strong>STEP 17 policy:</strong> a signed-in session is necessary but not sufficient—every protected route also checks the permission required for that module/action.</div></main></div></body></html>